  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "At Lang Ya blessed land’s Immortal Gu auction, Feng Jiu Ge, speaking as Swordmaster You Lan, offers Pulling Mountain Immortal Gu plus one hundred and fifty kilograms of heaven metal. Onlookers call heaven metal an immortal material on par with rule eye blood, produced only in the immemorial nine heavens. A hundred and fifty kilograms is treated as an extremely valuable sum that scares off most competitors. Crack divine water is said to be on par with heaven metal. Fang Yuan later multiplies Lang Ya land spirit’s list and demands three thousand kilograms of heaven metal and crack divine water, stunning the hall.",
